{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01318",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.83,
      "end_seconds": 4.09,
      "duration_seconds": 3.26,
      "text": "sorry, doctor, shall I sit here?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.55,
      "end_seconds": 9.89,
      "duration_seconds": 4.34,
      "text": "Of course, leave it there. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.67,
      "end_seconds": 20.39,
      "duration_seconds": 8.72,
      "text": "actually, honestly, it's a stiff painful shoulder, and my family pushed me to come"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 24.03,
      "end_seconds": 28.61,
      "duration_seconds": 4.58,
      "text": "Can I check a few measurements before we carry on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 35.52,
      "end_seconds": 37.75,
      "duration_seconds": 2.23,
      "text": "Okay, this won't take long..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 56.32,
      "end_seconds": 65.79,
      "duration_seconds": 9.47,
      "text": "Okay: oxygen saturation is 99 percent, BP is 111 over 82, pulse is 66 beats a minute, temp 36.9 degrees."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 69.68,
      "end_seconds": 71.29,
      "duration_seconds": 1.61,
      "text": "is that okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 71.86,
      "end_seconds": 73.97,
      "duration_seconds": 2.11,
      "text": "we'll go over that shortly"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 91.76,
      "end_seconds": 95.54,
      "duration_seconds": 3.78,
      "text": "When was the the first time you noticed it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 96.78,
      "end_seconds": 100.12,
      "duration_seconds": 3.34,
      "text": "it's been about two weeks now"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 101.05,
      "end_seconds": 104.39,
      "duration_seconds": 3.34,
      "text": "Have you noticed anything else alongside it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 105.99,
      "end_seconds": 118.69,
      "duration_seconds": 12.7,
      "text": "It usually comes with being woken at night by the pain. The, The being woken at night by the pain? That's been since last weekend."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 120.57,
      "end_seconds": 122.23,
      "duration_seconds": 1.66,
      "text": "What brings it on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 122.78,
      "end_seconds": 136.58,
      "duration_seconds": 13.8,
      "text": "I notice it more with lying on it. Well, I had not being able to lift my arm before. That's settled now, though."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 137.71,
      "end_seconds": 140.26,
      "duration_seconds": 2.55,
      "text": "did you notice any neck pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 140.76,
      "end_seconds": 142.97,
      "duration_seconds": 2.21,
      "text": "No, no neck pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 144.7,
      "end_seconds": 148.11,
      "duration_seconds": 3.41,
      "text": "Have you had any fall or numbness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 149.2,
      "end_seconds": 153.68,
      "duration_seconds": 4.48,
      "text": "Let me think, no, I'd have said so."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 157.03,
      "end_seconds": 160.08,
      "duration_seconds": 3.05,
      "text": "Alright, any rashes or skin problems otherwise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 161.0,
      "end_seconds": 163.65,
      "duration_seconds": 2.65,
      "text": "nothing on the skin, no"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 173.81,
      "end_seconds": 176.18,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "do you have any chronic illnesses?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 178.16,
      "end_seconds": 182.22,
      "duration_seconds": 4.06,
      "text": "Let me think, I've had diabetes, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 183.59,
      "end_seconds": 188.76,
      "duration_seconds": 5.17,
      "text": "so, yes, diabetes is known to us, good to have that clear"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 205.91,
      "end_seconds": 208.36,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "Tell me your medicines, please."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 208.97,
      "end_seconds": 216.43,
      "duration_seconds": 7.46,
      "text": "I, I take something called ibup... ibuprofen, 400 milligrams, maybe, when needed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 218.09,
      "end_seconds": 222.71,
      "duration_seconds": 4.62,
      "text": "Do you have the packet or the prescription with you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 224.21,
      "end_seconds": 228.42,
      "duration_seconds": 4.21,
      "text": "Not with me. I'll bring it next time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 229.79,
      "end_seconds": 232.06,
      "duration_seconds": 2.27,
      "text": "do you live by yourself?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 233.15,
      "end_seconds": 237.36,
      "duration_seconds": 4.21,
      "text": "No, I share a house with my brother."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 238.17,
      "end_seconds": 239.58,
      "duration_seconds": 1.41,
      "text": "What's your work?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 241.32,
      "end_seconds": 245.53,
      "duration_seconds": 4.21,
      "text": "I'm a plumber, lots of bending and kneeling."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 246.41,
      "end_seconds": 250.34,
      "duration_seconds": 3.93,
      "text": "Do you react to any medicines or foods? Any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 252.4,
      "end_seconds": 255.18,
      "duration_seconds": 2.78,
      "text": "I've never had an allergy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 257.01,
      "end_seconds": 259.3,
      "duration_seconds": 2.29,
      "text": "any surgery in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 261.29,
      "end_seconds": 265.67,
      "duration_seconds": 4.38,
      "text": "just an operation for a hernia, last spring"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 268.33,
      "end_seconds": 273.06,
      "duration_seconds": 4.73,
      "text": "I'd like to to check you over now, if that's alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 274.43,
      "end_seconds": 276.44,
      "duration_seconds": 2.01,
      "text": "Alright, nearly finished here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 292.17,
      "end_seconds": 296.58,
      "duration_seconds": 4.41,
      "text": "Movement is limited in all directions, both active and passive."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 300.03,
      "end_seconds": 320.33,
      "duration_seconds": 20.3,
      "text": "You can sit up now. From what you've told me and what I found, I think we're dealing with adhesive capsulitis, a frozen shoulder at this stage. I want to be honest that this is an impression, not a final answer. I can't rule out a rotator cuff problem yet."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 320.93,
      "end_seconds": 322.51,
      "duration_seconds": 1.58,
      "text": "is this permanent?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 323.35,
      "end_seconds": 351.48,
      "duration_seconds": 28.13,
      "text": "It's reasonable to be concerned, but right now adhesive capsulitis, a frozen shoulder is my leading thought, not anything worse. An X-ray of the shoulder is what I'd like next, for shoulder pain. Gentle daily stretches within comfort, and heat before them. Cut back on tea, coffee and fizzy drinks for a couple of weeks and see how things settle. I'm going to send a referral to physiotherapy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 353.58,
      "end_seconds": 368.25,
      "duration_seconds": 14.67,
      "text": "and please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose come back or go to emergency straight away if the symptoms get worse"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 370.08,
      "end_seconds": 375.38,
      "duration_seconds": 5.3,
      "text": "Hmm, you know, okay, I'll look out for that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 376.1,
      "end_seconds": 381.64,
      "duration_seconds": 5.54,
      "text": "We'll catch up in six weeks. That's all from me. Any questions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 383.63,
      "end_seconds": 386.75,
      "duration_seconds": 3.12,
      "text": "Great, thank you for your help."
    }
  ]
}